<div><Nav /><section class="section hero hero--aboutus hero-aboutus_v2"><div class="container__01"><div class="hero-wrapper align-top"><div class="hero-content"><h1 class="h1-heading">Case Results</h1><p class="paragraph__19 margin-64 hero mb-0">View our history of delivering justice through noteworthy verdicts and settlements..</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section attorneys"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading fade-up">Landmark Cases</h2><div class="hidden list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="attorneys-wrapper list-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/23895_1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/23895_1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Jayna Bosse</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_2.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Sandra West</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_3.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Nancy De La Cruz</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_4.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Dan Shah</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/23895_60.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/23895_60-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/23895_60.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Sonia Saba</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Tarrah-Lawrence_1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt=""><div class="attorney-name">Tarrah Lawrence</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Jenni-Teran-1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Jenni-Teran-1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/Jenni-Teran-1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Jenni Teran</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="attorneys-item"><img src="/images/Tobin-Apple-1.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Tobin-Apple-1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/Tobin-Apple-1.jpg 700w"><div class="attorney-name">Tobin Apple</div><div class="attorney-position">Firm Title</div></div></div></div></div><div class="collection-list-wrapper-5 list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="verdict-wrapper list-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MASS TORT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$51,000,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Barnett V. Merck</div><p class="paragraph-17">Part of trial team with lead counsel Mark Robinson, Jr. in the national bell weather Vioxx trial.</p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">TRUCK ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$21,200,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Roman V. U-haul</div><p class="paragraph-17">A negligent truck maneuver resulted in a catastrophic head-on collision, causing life-altering injuries.</p><a href="/blog/roman-family-awarded-21-2-million-in-u-haul-negligence-case" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">Brain Injury</div><div class="cases-settlement">30,000,000</div><div class="text-block-8">San Francisco County</div><p class="paragraph-17">MVA involving brain injury. Matter successfully resolved post-jury selection.</p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">TRUCK ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$15,990,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Koganti V. PODS</div><p class="paragraph-17">Rear-end collision involving a truck driver that was hauling PODS moving and storage containers.</p><a href="/blog/tbw-law-helps-client-achieve-big-verdict-against-uhaul" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MOTORCYCLE ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$14,600,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Poole v. Picazo </div><p class="paragraph-17">Motorcycle accident with auto making an incorrect left turn resulting in paraplegia. </p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">TRUCK ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$12,650,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Hernandez V. Penske</div><p class="paragraph-17">Head injury with cognitive deficits where plaintiff was disabled on freeway and struck by big rig truck.</p><a href="/blog/hernandez-settlement-documentary" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MOTORCYCLE ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$8,500,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Osburn V. FedEx</div><p class="paragraph-17">Truck vs motorcycle making an unsafe left turn resulted in significant orthopedic injuries.</p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">TRUCK ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$8,000,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Delgado V. Nissan</div><p class="paragraph-17">Truck struck the plaintiff’s parked vehicle. The plaintiff suffered a head laceration and spinal fracture</p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MOTORCYCLE ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$8,000,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Baker V. Vans </div><p class="paragraph-17">Employee of Vans and made an unsafe left turn into the plaintiff driving a motorcycle. </p><a href="/blog/motorcyclist-faces-life-altering-injuries-in-baker-v-doe-case" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MOTORCYCLE ACCIDENT</div><div class="cases-settlement">$7,000,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Condon V. Trucking</div><p class="paragraph-17">Big rig truck made an unsafe lane change into a motorcyclist resulting in a below the knee amputation. </p><a href="/blog/motorcyclist-wins-justice-in-condon-v-doe-after-devastating-crash" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">MEDICAL MALPRACTICE</div><div class="cases-settlement">$3,100,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Lefforge V. St. Edna</div><p class="paragraph-17">Podiatrist prescribed Morphine instead of Demerol resulting in anoxic brain injury.</p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="verdict-item"><div class="cases-type">PRODUCT LIABILITY</div><div class="cases-settlement">$1,350,000</div><div class="text-block-8">Farnsworth V. Manufacturer</div><p class="paragraph-17">Chair manufacturer's defective design resulted in a partial amputation of the plaintiff's finger. </p><a href="#" class="inline-block"><div class="text-block-9">Learn more</div></a></div></div></div><div role="navigation" aria-label="List" class="pagination-wrapper pagination-2"><a href="?36ae5784_page=0" aria-label="Previous Page" class="pagination-previous previous" style="display: none"><div class="text-block-10 mr-0">&lt;</div></a><div class="div-block-9"><div class="text-block-10 is-current" aria-current="page">1</div><div class="text-block-10">2</div></div><a href="?36ae5784_page=2" aria-label="Next Page" class="pagination-next next-2"><div class="text-block-10 mr-0">&gt;</div></a><link rel="prerender" href="?36ae5784_page=2"></div></div></div></div></section><Footer /></div><!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

